<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini no comment on Debis rumour.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini no comment on Debis rumour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cap Gemini said on Thursday it had no comment on rumours that Daimler-Benz unit Debis SH would significantly up its stake in the French computer services company.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The rumour holds that Debis would offer 300 francs per share to increase its stake from 24.4 percent to about 50 percent.</p>
<p>Cap Gemini shares were up 6.35 percent at 273 francs at 1520 GMT, off their high for the day of 275 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
